@startuml
' AI Task Tracker - implementation process activity diagram.
' Each action block = one role working on one task (role, task, execution time).
' Time metric: task start -> last working role checkpoint (CP-1/CP-2/CP-F),
' excluding user review wait. T-036 uses CP-1 (CP-F was recorded after review).
' T-013/T-015 use CP-2 (bugfix batch closure time is excluded).
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 6
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #555555
skinparam ArrowColor #555555
skinparam nodesep 12
skinparam ranksep 18
title AI Task Tracker - процесс реализации: роли x задачи x время

start

note right
